---
title: "EnrichedMember Derivation (stem-system types.ts)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_receive: receive Member
    q_receive --> q_omit: omit status, joined_at, deleted_at, is_admin
    q_omit --> q_resolve_display: resolve displayName
    q_resolve_display --> q_check_avatar: displayName = string
    q_check_avatar --> q_set_avatar: avatar_url != null
    q_check_avatar --> q_null_avatar: avatar_url = null
    q_set_avatar --> q_final: avatar_url = string
    q_null_avatar --> q_final: avatar_url = null
    q_final --> [*]: return EnrichedMember

    note right of q_omit
        INV-001: EnrichedMember retains supabase_auth_user_id, generation, student_number, discord_uid, discord_username
        INV-002: displayName must be non-empty string
        INV-003: Omitted fields (status, is_admin, joined_at, deleted_at) must not appear in result
    end note
